{"symbol":"RWL.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T23:08:18Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Kwidzynska 6","city":"Wroclaw","zip":"51-416","country":"Poland","phone":"48 71 326 0100","fax":"48 71 372 6111","website":"https://www.rawlplug.com","industry":"Tools & Accessories","industryKey":"tools-accessories","industryDisp":"Tools & Accessories","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Rawlplug S.A. design, manufacture, and sells fixings, fasteners, and tools under KOELNER, RAWPLUG, and MODECO EXPERT brands in Europe and internationally. It offers cordless and electric power tools, and power tool accessories; concrete and steel nail guns; accessories for nail guns and concrete; clips, washers, and tapes for nail guns; and building, mechanical, basic, cutting, measuring, connection, painting, and garden tools, as well as glue and glue guns, belts, health and safety articles, and tool transport accessories. The company also provides chemical resin fixings and mechanical anchors; wall plugs; frame, hammer, plasterboard, ceiling, facade, and roofing fixings; construction, wood, decking, drywall, self-drilling and tapping, steel, and frame screws; threaded roads, bolts and accessories, nails, wires, and hooks; and sealants, adhesives, expanding foams, polyurethane mortars and adhesives, silicones, and primer paint. In addition, it offers angle brackets, frame ties, brackets, special connectors, galvanized bands, latches and hinges, and building fittings; chains, steel wire and PVC coated steel, jute and polypropylene twisted ropes, elastic ropes, cords, and accessories; and radiator, curtain pole, outside light, gate, mirror, shelving, stairs, TV, hanging basket, and sanitary solution kits. Further, it wholesales construction materials; goods warehousing; develops building and property projects; generates and distributes electricity from renewable energy sources; and offers investment and technical support services. It serves construction, automotive, energy, road, wood, machinery, electrical machinery, and mining industries. The company was formerly known as Koelner S.A. and changed its name to Rawlplug S.A. in 2013. Rawlplug S.A. was founded in 1887 and is headquartered in Wroclaw, Poland. Rawlplug S.A. operates as a subsidiary of Amicus Poliniae Sp. z o.o.","fullTimeEmployees":2000,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Radoslaw  Koelner","title":"President of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Marek  Mokot","title":"Vice-President of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Piotr  Kopydlowski","title":"CFO & Member of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Przemyslaw  Tkaczyk","title":"Sales Director & Member of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Agnieszka  Spisak-Tobiasz","title":"Director of Accounting & Financial Reporting","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":15.25,"open":15.3,"dayLow":15,"dayHigh":15.3,"regularMarketPreviousClose":15.25,"regularMarketOpen":15.3,"regularMarketDayLow":15,"regularMarketDayHigh":15.3,"dividendRate":0.4,"dividendYield":0,"exDividendDate":1755043200,"payoutRatio":0.2963,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":2.98,"beta":0.346,"trailingPE":11.1111,"volume":940,"regularMarketVolume":940,"averageVolume":1184,"averageVolume10days":1562,"averageDailyVolume10Day":1562,"bid":14.7,"ask":15,"marketCap":465891008,"nonDilutedMarketCap":473655865,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":11.75,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":16.5,"allTimeHigh":77.95,"allTimeLow":5,"fulldayPrice":15,"fulldayChange":-0.25,"fulldayChangePercent":-1.63934,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.430994,"fiftyDayAverage":15.616,"twoHundredDayAverage":14.6115,"trailingAnnualDividendRate":0,"trailingAnnualDividendYield":0,"currency":"PLN","tradeable":false,"enterpriseValue"